        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion SI-A2, 3040 Modern Cast Stainless Steel Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fusion Hardware 3040 Stainless Steel Lever features a 2 piece lever and stem design making it a popular choice of interior design professionals. Available in either Brushed or Polished Stainless Steel finishes. Easy to install, this long lasting stainless steel door lever is backed by a lifetime warranty. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion SI-A2 Contemporary Stainless Steel Lever With Contemporary Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Modern 3040 Stainless Steel Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern 3040 Stainless Steel Leverset, Fusion SI-A2",
                "description": "3040 Cast Stainless Steel Leverset Fusion SI-A2 - The Fusion Hardware 3040 Stainless Steel Lever features a 2 piece lever and stem design making it a popular choice of interior design professionals.  Available in either Brushed or Polished Stainless Steel finishes. Easy to install, this long lasting stainless steel door lever is backed by a lifetime warranty. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
